5,1,1,talk,Yumi,,Hi everyone! I'm so excited to help. I want to make sure whatever we pick actually lasts and doesn't just disappear when things get tough.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,A pleasure to be here. I suspect we might find the answers we need in the archives; it would be a pity to repeat old mistakes.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shion,,"I'll be looking at the practical side. It's easy to propose a service, but quite another to actually have the people capable of running it.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Minako,,Let's stay focused on the long-term viability. I'm particularly interested in how the funding is structured to avoid the usual second-year shortfall.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,Um... I just worry about the people who can't get to us. I want to know if we're accidentally leaving some neighborhoods behind.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Benjamin, that's a great point! Maybe we should check those old records you mentioned?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"Precisely, Yumi. I'll take a look at those. I also wonder about the current equipment costs to see where the money actually goes.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Shion,,"I'll check the volunteer register. If we don't have the skills on the roster, the project is dead on arrival.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Minako,,I agree with the need for data. I'll examine the grant terms and the endowment to see how the funding is shaped.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,I... I think I'll look into the bus links in the outer wards. And maybe the road closures?,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Yumi,,"I'll look into the winter road closures too, just to be safe! And maybe the delivery windows from suppliers?","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,pass,Benjamin,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Shion,,I'll also check the neighbourhood associations and tool certification. We need to know who is actually qualified.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Minako,,I'll also look at the running and equipment lines from last year to see the actual spending patterns.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
