60,3,1,talk,Yumi,,"I'm voting for the Language Learning Circles! It's friendly, community-focused, and seems sustainable.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Benjamin,,I concur. Candidate C is the only one supported by the historical evidence of success in this system.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Shion,,Candidate C is the only one that doesn't create a supervision crisis for the staff. I'm in.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Minako,,"Given the grant terms and the vehicle overruns, Candidate C is the only viable financial choice.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Daisuke,,"I wanted the mobile service, but the budget sounds too risky. I'll vote for C if it helps the outer wards.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Yumi,,Yay! I'm so glad we all agree. It's going to be wonderful!,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Benjamin,,It is a rare moment of total alignment. Logic prevails.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Shion,,It's the most efficient path. No need to argue further.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Minako,,I'm glad we looked at the numbers first. It saved us from a costly mistake.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Daisuke,,I just hope the partners can actually get to those neighborhoods.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
